        <Row Tag="LOC_POLICY_DAP_CHATTEL_SLAVERY_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
            <Text>Can capture defeated enemy civilization combat units (non-barbarian) and convert them to Builders. [COLOR_RED]-1 [ICON_GLORY_DARK_AGE] Era Score from defeating civilization combat units.[ENDCOLOR]</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_POLICY_DAP_CHATTEL_SLAVERY_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
            <Text>击败敌方文明战斗单位（非蛮族）可将其俘虏并转化为建造者。[COLOR_RED]击败文明战斗单位时-1 [ICON_GLORY_DARK_AGE] 时代分。[ENDCOLOR]</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_POLICY_DAP_CHILD_SOLDIERS_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
            <Text>All units gain +100% Combat Experience. [COLOR_RED]-1 [ICON_GLORY_DARK_AGE] Era Score from promoting a Combat Unit.[ENDCOLOR]</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_POLICY_DAP_CHILD_SOLDIERS_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
            <Text>所有单位获得 +100% 战斗经验。[COLOR_RED]战斗单位晋升时-1 [ICON_GLORY_DARK_AGE] 时代分。[ENDCOLOR]</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_POLICY_DAP_GREAT_MIGRATION_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
            <Text>New cities begin with +1 [ICON_CITIZEN] Population.[NEWLINE][COLOR_RED]-2 [ICON_GLORY_DARK_AGE] Era Score from founding new cities.[ENDCOLOR]</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_POLICY_DAP_GREAT_MIGRATION_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
            <Text>新建城市初始获得 +1 [ICON_CITIZEN] 人口。[NEWLINE][COLOR_RED]建立新城市时-2 [ICON_GLORY_DARK_AGE] 时代分。[ENDCOLOR]</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_POLICY_DAP_LABOUR_CAMPS_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
            <Text>+0.4 [ICON_PRODUCTION] Production per Citizen in cities with a Governor. [COLOR_RED]-1 [ICON_GLORY_DARK_AGE] Era Score when a city completes production.[ENDCOLOR]</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_POLICY_DAP_LABOUR_CAMPS_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
            <Text>有总督的城市中，每个公民 +0.4 [ICON_PRODUCTION] 生产力。[COLOR_RED]城市完成生产时-1 [ICON_GLORY_DARK_AGE] 时代分。[ENDCOLOR]</Text>
        </Row>

